menu "WROVER board display"
    config BOARD_DISPLAY_ENABLE
        bool "Enable confirmed ILI9341 board display"
        default n
    config BOARD_DISPLAY_DMA_PIPELINE
        bool "Overlap LCD strip rendering with one DMA transfer (experimental)"
        depends on BOARD_DISPLAY_ENABLE
        default n
        help
            Allocate a second internal DMA-capable strip buffer and render the
            next strip while the previous transfer is in flight. The SPI clock
            and transaction queue depth are unchanged. DMA resources are
            quarantined on uncertain completion. Normal operation has limited
            hardware coverage; fault paths and visual output remain unvalidated.
    config BOARD_WROVER_KIT_V41_CONFIRMED
        bool "PCB silkscreen and official v4.1 LCD wiring confirmed"
        depends on BOARD_DISPLAY_ENABLE
        default n
        help
            Required before any LCD GPIO is configured. This does not identify
            the panel controller. Two consistent ILI9341 ID reads are required;
            unknown or different IDs stop the display without trying other drivers.
endmenu
